{"file": "退役归来，这个保镖不好惹-第52集.mp4", "ep": 52, "duration": 95.9, "segments": [{"start": 0.37, "end": 2.65, "text": "这就是你家"}, {"start": 4.01, "end": 5.49, "text": "不嫌弃就进来坐会"}, {"start": 9.38, "end": 11.14, "text": "这是我妹妹陈婷婷"}, {"start": 11.14, "end": 12.62, "text": "婷婷 叫张总"}, {"start": 13.78, "end": 14.74, "text": "张总好"}, {"start": 15.76, "end": 16.88, "text": "叫姐姐就行"}, {"start": 17.28, "end": 18.24, "text": "快考考了"}, {"start": 19.32, "end": 20.92, "text": "你爸妈呢"}, {"start": 22.61, "end": 23.57, "text": "都去世了"}, {"start": 25.25, "end": 26.69, "text": "我爸走了好几年"}, {"start": 26.93, "end": 28.41, "text": "我妈前几天刚走的"}, {"start": 29.38, "end": 30.22, "text": "对不起"}, {"start": 31.22, "end": 31.94, "text": "没事"}, {"start": 32.47, "end": 33.87, "text": "我哥回来的第二天"}, {"start": 33.87, "end": 34.75, "text": "我妈走的"}, {"start": 35.7, "end": 37.54, "text": "他十八岁就去当安全员"}, {"start": 37.9, "end": 38.9, "text": "当了十年"}, {"start": 40.71, "end": 41.39, "text": "张总"}, {"start": 41.95, "end": 42.71, "text": "我们走吧"}, {"start": 45.84, "end": 46.48, "text": "妹妹"}, {"start": 46.8, "end": 48.0, "text": "高三药补营养"}, {"start": 48.2, "end": 49.4, "text": "想吃什么自己买"}, {"start": 49.83, "end": 51.07, "text": "不 不 不行"}, {"start": 51.27, "end": 51.83, "text": "婷婷"}, {"start": 52.74, "end": 53.86, "text": "把钱还给张总"}, {"start": 54.47, "end": 55.71, "text": "钱又不是给你的"}, {"start": 55.95, "end": 56.91, "text": "关你什么事"}, {"start": 57.15, "end": 58.71, "text": "张总 心意领了"}, {"start": 58.91, "end": 60.07, "text": "钱 不能拿"}, {"start": 60.19, "end": 61.19, "text": "她还没成年"}, {"start": 61.43, "end": 62.83, "text": "不能让她习惯被可怜"}, {"start": 64.39, "end": 66.19, "text": "人穷 腰板不能弯"}, {"start": 67.1, "end": 68.1, "text": "晚了 回去吧"}, {"start": 68.1, "end": 69.02, "text": "我在车上等你"}, {"start": 69.26, "end": 70.42, "text": "你妹妹说"}, {"start": 70.42, "end": 71.82, "text": "你当了十年安全员"}, {"start": 72.14, "end": 73.06, "text": "为什么回来了"}, {"start": 74.38, "end": 75.02, "text": "开除"}, {"start": 76.15, "end": 76.99, "text": "开除"}, {"start": 77.55, "end": 78.15, "text": "为什么"}, {"start": 79.03, "end": 79.87, "text": "做错了事"}, {"start": 80.15, "end": 81.11, "text": "所以被开除"}, {"start": 82.93, "end": 83.89, "text": "你在那里到底"}, {"start": 84.09, "end": 84.69, "text": "到家了"}]}